source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A backslash run right before the closing bracket makes Jira render no link at all and break the line there; jiro keeps the bracket run as text with the same hard break.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x/a\\]
-- rendered.html --
<p>[x|http://x/a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />]</p>
-- want.md --
\[x|http://x/a\
\]
-- warnings.json --
[]
